# Word of Command (CR 723.2, 723.7; owner ruling 2026-11-27): Bot2 is made to cast Brainstorm. Its Tolarian Academy, with
# three artifacts beside it, makes {U}{U}{U}: one pays for Brainstorm, and over-producing is fine - the {U}{U} left over is
# ordinary mana. Once Word of Command has resolved, Bot2 spends it on Counterspell, countering the Brainstorm itself.

